   cdc_manual_audit.rpt covers all intentional async/mixed-domain structures
   timing_pd_capture_hotspots.rpt reports PD capture WNS separately from aggregate WNS
   timing_osc_counter_hotspots.rpt reports u_fast_cnt/u_slow_cnt/start watchdog support-counter WNS separately
   timing_meas_ctrl_hotspots.rpt and timing_context_bank_hotspots.rpt identify logic-vs-wire blockers
   report_design_rules.rpt has no critical transition/fanout/capacitance issues
